            "id": "01fb27ed221b9d386699278e013c4598",
            "documentId": "494fcb24938007bb448408926130e107",
            "url": "https://everstake.com/resources/blog/how-to-stake-01-ether-or-more-on-the-everstake-website",
            "title": "How to Stake 0.1 Ether or more on the Everstake website | Everstake",
            "text": "## We’re thrilled to announce our native staking solution, allowing everyone to stake Ethereum starting from as little as 0.1 ETH. In this article, you’ll find a clear understanding of staking, the distinct advantages of staking with Everstake, and a detailed walkthrough on how to stake and unstake your Ether. OCT 02, 2023 Last updated AUG 19, 2026 · V1 Share with your network Table of Contents What makes Instant Stake different from Regular Staking? What do you need to know before you start staking? How to stake ETH Stake ETH Faster Using Everstake’s Instant Stake How to Unstake ETH Everstake’s Reward System Explained The Takeaway Show NOTE: As of June 2026, the minimum to stake ETH with Everstake is 0.01 ETH, down from 0.1 ETH. The new minimum applies to new stakes only. Figures and screenshots elsewhere in this article may still reflect the old 0.1 ETH minimum. See current minimums on the ETH staking page (https://everstake.one/staking/protocols/ethereum). Blockchain technology has reshaped our understanding of currencies and introduced a new paradigm of assets and wealth generation mechanisms. At the heart of these mechanisms, staking is a pivotal process ensuring decentralized networks’ security and functionality. There are numerous staking opportunities, and choosing the proper validator can differentiate between substantial gains and missed opportunities. Everstake (https://everstake.one/), with its impressive infrastructure powered by over 8,000 nodes, is recognized for its unparalleled efficiency, ironclad security, and consistent returns.",
            "authority": 1,
            "publisher": "Everstake",
            "publishedAt": "2023-10-02T13:56:00.000Z",
            "updatedAt": "2026-08-19T11:42:43.000Z",
            "fetchedAt": "2026-09-13T14:03:14.353Z",
            "duplicateGroup": "494fcb24938007bb448408926130e107",
            "score": 0.03149801587301587,
            "reason": "Lexical and semantic rank fusion; diversified by content group. Authority and temporal validity checked separately.",
            "metadata": {
              "sourceId": "everstake-com"
